
# Product List Automation (Java - Selenium)

## 📌 Project Description
This project automates a product listing scenario using Selenium WebDriver in Java.  
It performs navigation, filtering, counting items, handling popups, and capturing screenshots.

## 🎯 Objective
- Automate product navigation in an e-commerce website
- Handle login popup (OTP screen)
- Apply product filters
- Count and display products
- Capture screenshot for validation

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- Java
- Selenium WebDriver
- ChromeDriver / FirefoxDriver

---

## ⚙️ Features
- Launch browser (Chrome / Firefox)
- Open Pepperfry website
- Handle login popup using mouse click
- Navigate to Furniture → Benches
- Count total products
- Apply "Material → Metal" filter
- Count filtered products
- Take screenshot
- Close browser

